{"id":"spells","title":"Spells","category":"combat","icon":"skyrpg_magic:fireball_scroll","summary":"The twelve spells of the wands: what each does, mana and cooldown, charging, and where to get every scroll.","blocks":[{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"Spells are what "},{"x":"wands","link":"wands"},{"x":" cast. Each spell is a "},{"x":"scroll","b":true},{"x":" you install in a wand's slot; the wand's "},{"x":"selected","b":true},{"x":" spell is the one "},{"x":"left click","b":true},{"x":" casts. There are "},{"x":"twelve","b":true},{"x":" in five elements: "},{"x":"Fire","b":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"Frost","b":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"Lightning","b":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"Arcane","b":true},{"x":" and "},{"x":"Nature","b":true},{"x":". A spell costs "},{"x":"mana","b":true},{"x":" and has a "},{"x":"cooldown","b":true},{"x":" (the time before you can cast that spell again, shown as a sweep on the HUD box and on the spell wheel). Two spells can be "},{"x":"charged","b":true},{"x":": hold left click and let go."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"How spells deal damage","anchor":"how-spells-deal-damage"},{"t":"ul","items":[{"s":[{"x":"Spell damage is the spell's base damage times "},{"x":"(1 + Intelligence / 100)","b":true},{"x":", so Intelligence from your wand and gear makes every spell stronger. Your wand may add more: the Emberheart Staff adds 25% to fire spells and the Frostspire Staff 25% to frost spells."}]},{"s":[{"x":"A spell hit is a normal hit as far as everything else goes: "},{"x":"damage numbers","b":true},{"x":" appear over the target, kills give you "},{"x":"Combat XP","b":true},{"x":", Valor Marks and loot, and they count for "},{"x":"slayer","b":true},{"x":" quests and bosses. "},{"x":"Strength and crits do not apply","b":true},{"x":"; Intelligence does the same job."}]},{"s":[{"x":"Spells never hurt "},{"x":"you","b":true},{"x":", your "},{"x":"party","b":true},{"x":" members, your pets, NPCs or villagers. Other players are only hit where player fighting is allowed. Area spells and chains go for hostile mobs; a bolt hits whatever it touches."}]},{"s":[{"x":"Fireballs and meteors "},{"x":"break no blocks and start no fires","b":true},{"x":". "},{"x":"Burning","b":true},{"x":" is the spell's own damage over time and counts as your damage too, but water puts it out."}]},{"s":[{"x":"Mana is 100 + your Intelligence and refills 2% of the maximum a second. See "},{"x":"Stats","link":"stats"},{"x":"."}]}]},{"t":"h2","text":"The twelve spells","anchor":"the-twelve-spells"},{"t":"table","head":[[{"x":"Spell"}],[{"x":"Element"}],[{"x":"Rarity"}],[{"x":"Mana"}],[{"x":"Cooldown"}],[{"x":"What it does"}]],"rows":[[[{"x":"Firebolt","item":"skyrpg_magic:firebolt_scroll","icon":"skyrpg_magic:firebolt_scroll","color":"#FFFFFF"}],[{"x":"Fire"}],[{"x":"Common"}],[{"x":"8"}],[{"x":"0.5 s"}],[{"x":"A fast bolt for "},{"x":"35","b":true},{"x":" damage that "},{"x":"burns","b":true},{"x":" for 3 seconds (8 a second)."}]],[[{"x":"Fireball","item":"skyrpg_magic:fireball_scroll","icon":"skyrpg_magic:fireball_scroll","color":"#55FF55"}],[{"x":"Fire"}],[{"x":"Uncommon"}],[{"x":"24"}],[{"x":"3 s"}],[{"x":"Chargeable.","b":true},{"x":" Explodes on impact: "},{"x":"70","b":true},{"x":" damage in a 3 block radius (less towards the edge) and burns for 4 seconds. Fully charged, the blast is "},{"x":"5.5 blocks wide and hits twice as hard","b":true},{"x":"."}]],[[{"x":"Meteor","item":"skyrpg_magic:meteor_scroll","icon":"skyrpg_magic:meteor_scroll","color":"#FFAA00"}],[{"x":"Fire"}],[{"x":"Legendary"}],[{"x":"60"}],[{"x":"12 s"}],[{"x":"Chargeable.","b":true},{"x":" A ring marks where you aim, and a meteor crashes there 1.3 seconds later for "},{"x":"170","b":true},{"x":" damage in 5 blocks and 5 seconds of burning. Charged: "},{"x":"8 blocks and double damage","b":true},{"x":"."}]],[[{"x":"Frost Shard","item":"skyrpg_magic:frost_shard_scroll","icon":"skyrpg_magic:frost_shard_scroll","color":"#FFFFFF"}],[{"x":"Frost"}],[{"x":"Common"}],[{"x":"7"}],[{"x":"0.6 s"}],[{"x":"A fast shard that "},{"x":"pierces up to 3 enemies","b":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"32","b":true},{"x":" damage each, and "},{"x":"slows","b":true},{"x":" them (Slowness III for 2.5 seconds)."}]],[[{"x":"Blizzard","item":"skyrpg_magic:blizzard_scroll","icon":"skyrpg_magic:blizzard_scroll","color":"#5555FF"}],[{"x":"Frost"}],[{"x":"Rare"}],[{"x":"50"}],[{"x":"14 s"}],[{"x":"A snowstorm where you aim, 5 blocks wide, for 6 seconds: "},{"x":"24","b":true},{"x":" damage twice a second and a slow on everything inside."}]],[[{"x":"Chain Lightning","item":"skyrpg_magic:chain_lightning_scroll","icon":"skyrpg_magic:chain_lightning_scroll","color":"#5555FF"}],[{"x":"Lightning"}],[{"x":"Rare"}],[{"x":"22"}],[{"x":"2.5 s"}],[{"x":"A bolt for "},{"x":"52","b":true},{"x":" damage that "},{"x":"leaps between up to 4 enemies","b":true},{"x":" within 7 blocks of each other (5 with the Tempest Scepter). With nothing to hit it fizzles and costs nothing."}]],[[{"x":"Thunderclap","item":"skyrpg_magic:thunderclap_scroll","icon":"skyrpg_magic:thunderclap_scroll","color":"#AA00AA"}],[{"x":"Lightning"}],[{"x":"Epic"}],[{"x":"38"}],[{"x":"8 s"}],[{"x":"Thunder rolls out from you: everything within 6 blocks takes "},{"x":"62","b":true},{"x":" damage, is "},{"x":"thrown back and stunned","b":true},{"x":" for 1.4 seconds."}]],[[{"x":"Arcane Missiles","item":"skyrpg_magic:arcane_missiles_scroll","icon":"skyrpg_magic:arcane_missiles_scroll","color":"#55FF55"}],[{"x":"Arcane"}],[{"x":"Uncommon"}],[{"x":"26"}],[{"x":"4 s"}],[{"x":"Three homing missiles","b":true},{"x":" fan out and bend towards your enemies, "},{"x":"30","b":true},{"x":" damage each."}]],[[{"x":"Blink","item":"skyrpg_magic:blink_scroll","icon":"skyrpg_magic:blink_scroll","color":"#55FF55"}],[{"x":"Arcane"}],[{"x":"Uncommon"}],[{"x":"16"}],[{"x":"6 s"}],[{"x":"Teleports","b":true},{"x":" you up to 8 blocks the way you look, as far as there is room and a safe floor. Never into a wall or lava. With no room it costs nothing."}]],[[{"x":"Mana Shield","item":"skyrpg_magic:mana_shield_scroll","icon":"skyrpg_magic:mana_shield_scroll","color":"#5555FF"}],[{"x":"Arcane"}],[{"x":"Rare"}],[{"x":"30"}],[{"x":"20 s"}],[{"x":"For 8 seconds "},{"x":"damage you take is paid from your mana","b":true},{"x":" instead, half a mana per point. When the mana runs out the shield breaks and the hit lands."}]],[[{"x":"Healing Pulse","item":"skyrpg_magic:healing_pulse_scroll","icon":"skyrpg_magic:healing_pulse_scroll","color":"#FFFFFF"}],[{"x":"Nature"}],[{"x":"Common"}],[{"x":"30"}],[{"x":"6 s"}],[{"x":"A wave of green light that "},{"x":"heals you and party members","b":true},{"x":" within 8 blocks for 60 health."}]],[[{"x":"Entangle","item":"skyrpg_magic:entangle_scroll","icon":"skyrpg_magic:entangle_scroll","color":"#55FF55"}],[{"x":"Nature"}],[{"x":"Uncommon"}],[{"x":"25"}],[{"x":"9 s"}],[{"x":"Vines "},{"x":"root","b":true},{"x":" every enemy in a 4 block circle where you aim for 4 seconds and hurt them for "},{"x":"14","b":true},{"x":" a second."}]]],"align":["l","l","l","l","l","l"]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"x":"Item"}],[{"x":"Rarity"}],[{"x":"Key stats"}],[{"x":"Sells for"}],[{"x":"How to get"}]],"rows":[[[{"x":"Firebolt Scroll","item":"skyrpg_magic:firebolt_scroll","icon":"skyrpg_magic:firebolt_scroll","color":"#FFFFFF"}],[{"x":"Common","color":"#FFFFFF"}],[{"x":""}],[{"x":"150 coins"}],[{"x":"Sold by Seraphine's Scrolls for 500 coins"}]],[[{"x":"Fireball Scroll","item":"skyrpg_magic:fireball_scroll","icon":"skyrpg_magic:fireball_scroll","color":"#55FF55"}],[{"x":"Uncommon","color":"#55FF55"}],[{"x":""}],[{"x":"800 coins"}],[{"x":""}]],[[{"x":"Meteor Scroll","item":"skyrpg_magic:meteor_scroll","icon":"skyrpg_magic:meteor_scroll","color":"#FFAA00"}],[{"x":"Legendary","color":"#FFAA00"}],[{"x":""}],[{"x":"60,000 coins"}],[{"x":""}]],[[{"x":"Frost Shard Scroll","item":"skyrpg_magic:frost_shard_scroll","icon":"skyrpg_magic:frost_shard_scroll","color":"#FFFFFF"}],[{"x":"Common","color":"#FFFFFF"}],[{"x":""}],[{"x":"150 coins"}],[{"x":"Sold by Seraphine's Scrolls for 500 coins"}]],[[{"x":"Blizzard Scroll","item":"skyrpg_magic:blizzard_scroll","icon":"skyrpg_magic:blizzard_scroll","color":"#5555FF"}],[{"x":"Rare","color":"#5555FF"}],[{"x":""}],[{"x":"5,000 coins"}],[{"x":""}]],[[{"x":"Chain Lightning Scroll","item":"skyrpg_magic:chain_lightning_scroll","icon":"skyrpg_magic:chain_lightning_scroll","color":"#5555FF"}],[{"x":"Rare","color":"#5555FF"}],[{"x":""}],[{"x":"4,000 coins"}],[{"x":""}]],[[{"x":"Thunderclap Scroll","item":"skyrpg_magic:thunderclap_scroll","icon":"skyrpg_magic:thunderclap_scroll","color":"#AA00AA"}],[{"x":"Epic","color":"#AA00AA"}],[{"x":""}],[{"x":"18,000 coins"}],[{"x":""}]],[[{"x":"Arcane Missiles Scroll","item":"skyrpg_magic:arcane_missiles_scroll","icon":"skyrpg_magic:arcane_missiles_scroll","color":"#55FF55"}],[{"x":"Uncommon","color":"#55FF55"}],[{"x":""}],[{"x":"900 coins"}],[{"x":""}]],[[{"x":"Blink Scroll","item":"skyrpg_magic:blink_scroll","icon":"skyrpg_magic:blink_scroll","color":"#55FF55"}],[{"x":"Uncommon","color":"#55FF55"}],[{"x":""}],[{"x":"700 coins"}],[{"x":""}]],[[{"x":"Mana Shield Scroll","item":"skyrpg_magic:mana_shield_scroll","icon":"skyrpg_magic:mana_shield_scroll","color":"#5555FF"}],[{"x":"Rare","color":"#5555FF"}],[{"x":""}],[{"x":"4,500 coins"}],[{"x":""}]],[[{"x":"Healing Pulse Scroll","item":"skyrpg_magic:healing_pulse_scroll","icon":"skyrpg_magic:healing_pulse_scroll","color":"#FFFFFF"}],[{"x":"Common","color":"#FFFFFF"}],[{"x":""}],[{"x":"200 coins"}],[{"x":"Sold by Seraphine's Scrolls for 700 coins"}]],[[{"x":"Entangle Scroll","item":"skyrpg_magic:entangle_scroll","icon":"skyrpg_magic:entangle_scroll","color":"#55FF55"}],[{"x":"Uncommon","color":"#55FF55"}],[{"x":""}],[{"x":"700 coins"}],[{"x":""}]]],"align":["l","l","l","l","l"]},{"t":"callout","kind":"note","b":[{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"Damage is shown in SkyRPG damage, the same unit as weapon damage and the numbers over mobs. The figures in the table are before Intelligence and wand bonuses: with 100 Intelligence, double."}]}]},{"t":"h2","text":"Charging","anchor":"charging"},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"Fireball and Meteor can be "},{"x":"charged","b":true},{"x":". Hold "},{"x":"left click","b":true},{"x":" with the spell selected: a ring fills around your crosshair (about 1.5 seconds) with a rising chime, then pings when it is full. Let go to cast. A quick tap casts the small version. Mana is checked when you start and spent when the spell goes off. Switching the held item cancels a charge, and so does anything that leaves you unable to cast when you let go (no mana, or the spell still recharging)."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"Getting scrolls","anchor":"getting-scrolls"},{"t":"table","head":[[{"x":"Rarity"}],[{"x":"Where"}]],"rows":[[[{"x":"Common (Firebolt, Frost Shard, Healing Pulse)"}],[{"x":"Seraphine Vael","b":true},{"x":" at the Arcane Library sells them: 500, 500 and 700 coins. Sneak and talk to her. See "},{"x":"NPCs","link":"npcs"},{"x":"."}]],[[{"x":"Uncommon (Fireball, Blink, Arcane Missiles, Entangle)"}],[{"x":"The "},{"x":"Artisan Bench","link":"crafting"},{"x":", "},{"x":"Enchanting 8 to 10","b":true},{"x":": paper, Runic Dust and materials of the element."}]],[[{"x":"Rare (Chain Lightning, Blizzard, Mana Shield)"}],[{"x":"The Artisan Bench, "},{"x":"Enchanting 20 to 22","b":true},{"x":", and they "},{"x":"drop","b":true},{"x":" from bosses."}]],[[{"x":"Epic (Thunderclap) and Legendary (Meteor)"}],[{"x":"Drop only","b":true},{"x":", from the hardest bosses and dungeon rewards (the Ender Wyrm, the Star Warden, the Iron Thane and others), at a low chance. A "},{"x":"Blood Moon","b":true},{"x":" also makes hostile mobs you kill drop a scroll now and then (not a Meteor)."}]]],"align":["l","l"]},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"Scrolls can be sold to the NPCs and traded. Installing one in a wand does not use it up: take it out again and you have it back. Scroll recipes: Fireball (paper, Ember Core, Blaze Powder), Blink (paper, Ender Pearl, Amethyst Shard), Arcane Missiles (paper, Amethyst, Wisp Essence), Entangle (paper, Vine, Dew Vial), Chain Lightning (paper, Stormfeather, Skyiron Ingot), Blizzard (paper, Rime Shard, Frost Essence) and Mana Shield (paper, Glimmer Crystal, Wisp Essence), all with Runic Dust."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"Effects you will notice","anchor":"effects-you-will-notice"},{"t":"ul","items":[{"s":[{"x":"Every spell flashes at the wand when it goes off and has its own "},{"x":"trail","b":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"impact burst","b":true},{"x":" and "},{"x":"sound","b":true},{"x":"."}]},{"s":[{"x":"Meteor","b":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"Thunderclap","b":true},{"x":", a charged "},{"x":"Fireball","b":true},{"x":" and the start of a "},{"x":"Blizzard","b":true},{"x":" shake the screen for anyone close."}]},{"s":[{"x":"Lightning","b":true},{"x":" is drawn as jagged arcs between targets; a Thunderclap also calls lightning on a few of the enemies it stuns."}]},{"s":[{"x":"A "},{"x":"Mana Shield","b":true},{"x":" circles you with blue light, flashes when it absorbs a hit and says how much it took."}]}]},{"t":"h2","text":"See also","anchor":"see-also"},{"t":"ul","items":[{"s":[{"x":"Wands","link":"wands"}]},{"s":[{"x":"Stats","link":"stats"}]},{"s":[{"x":"Combat basics","link":"combat-basics"}]},{"s":[{"x":"Party","link":"party"}]},{"s":[{"x":"Enchanting","link":"enchanting"}]}]}]}